# Optional — enables Run with AI (/v1/ai/run, tabhandoff run-ai) and the
# Playwright LLM browser loop. Without a key, TabHandoff stays package + DOM extract.
# Keys stay in process env / local settings only — never written into ZIP packages or logs.
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
# OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
# OPENAI_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-sonnet-4-20250514

# Optional override for receipt/job store (default: ~/.tabhandoff)
# TABHANDOFF_HOME=
